# GMS's own figures: 365+8x% twice on six enemies, and a dark shuriken that
# attacks six times for 9+3*floor(x/6)% every five seconds, doing 200% more to
# ordinary monsters. The taunt is dropped (nothing here can be taunted), but the
# bonus from taunted enemies stays: GMS's ceil(x/6)% covers EXP and Item Drop
# Rate alike, both given permanently, stepped evenly.
#
# The shuriken is a side strike, not a summon, on purpose: it must come out with
# this swing only, or a Night Lord using Quad Star on a boss would be firing it
# the whole time. Its six enemies are stated instead of taken from the swing,
# because GMS's Showdown - Spread widens the talisman and leaves the shuriken at
# six.
#
# Six go out, and each hunts ONE enemy (`mobCount` is 1 in the client). So it
# scatters: against six monsters each takes one, and against a lone boss all six
# hit it, with the second and later ones at half damage, as GMS states outright.
name: "Showdown"
description:
  "Attacks enemies and provokes them. Provoked enemies grant more EXP. When "
  "the talisman explodes, it creates a dark shuriken, which then pursues and "
  "attacks nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_NIGHT_LORD skill_order: 2 }
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_CLAW
exceeds_master_level: true
base_delay_ms: 660
max_enemies: 6
lines: 2
base {
  skill_pct: 3.73
  exp_pct: 0.0065
  item_drop_pct: 0.0065
}
per_level {
  skill_pct: 0.08
  exp_pct: 0.0015
  item_drop_pct: 0.0015
}
side_strike {
  label: "Shuriken"
  max_enemies: 6
  lines: 6
  cooldown_seconds: 5.0
  base {
    skill_pct: 0.095
    normal_pct: 2.00
  }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.005 }
  scatter {
    hits: 6
    repeat_final_dmg_pct: -0.50
  }
}
